        {
          "text": "Wageza izibilini namathambo ngamanzi; uMose wayishisa yonke inqama e-altare; kwakungumnikelo wokushiswa wephunga elimnandi nomnikelo womlilo kuJehova; njengalokho uJehova emyalile uMose.",
