        },
        {
          "text": "Wayihlaba; uMose wathatha igazi layo, walibheca esicutshini sokunene sendlebe ka-Aroni yokunene, nasesithupheni sesandla sakhe sokunene nakuqukula wonyawo lwakhe lokunene.",
