              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasondeza amadodana ka-Aroni, uMose wafafaza elinye igazi esicutshini sendlebe yawo yokunene, nasezithupheni zesandla sawo sokunene, nakuqukula wonyawo lwawo lokunene; uMose wafafaza i-altare ngegazi nxazonke.",
