              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eqomeni lesinkwa esingenamvubelo esasiphambi kukaJehova, wathatha iqebelengwane elilodwa elingenamvubelo neqebelengwane elilodwa lamafutha neqebelengwane elilodwa wakubeka emanoni nasehlombe lokunene.",
