        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wayesethatha isifuba, wasinyakazisa njengomnikelo wokuzuliswa phambi kukaJehova; ngoba enqameni yokwahlukaniselwa kwakuyisabelo sikaMose; njengalokho uJehova emyalile uMose.",
