              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wathatha amafutha okugcoba negazi elalise-altare, wafafaza ngalo u-Aroni nasezingutsheni zakhe, naphezu kwamadodana akhe, nasezingutsheni zamadodana akhe kanye naye; wangcwelisa u-Aroni nezingubo zakhe namadodana akhe nezambatho zamadodana akhe kanye naye.",
